msgid "About"
msgstr "О программе"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2146
msgid "Built with Rust, egui, and librespot. Not affiliated with Spotify."
msgstr "Создано на Rust, egui и librespot. Не связано со Spotify."

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2148
msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "Проверить обновления"

#: src/ui/settings.rs:2149
